{
    "title": "Stick Fight: Epic Warriors",
    "description": "Lead your warrior to the Victory! \r\nLet's dive into the world where you can build your army. To defeat your rival, you have to build your stickman warriors from an unarmed army to a modern one. You will need a big brain and a solid strategy to win. \r\n\r\nFeatures of Stick Fight: Epic Warriors: \r\n\u25b6\ufe0e Evolve stick man from weak to strong power \r\n\u25b6\ufe0e Build an army unit with different stick man warrior strengths \r\n\u25b6\ufe0e Manage energy and resources to evolve your army \r\n\r\nWhat makes Stick Fight: Epic Warriors different: \r\n\u27a1\ufe0e Fun gameplay: Explore the fun and addictive battles between Red Stickman and Blue Stickman \r\n\u27a1\ufe0e Various characters: each of them portrays a different battle style \r\n\u27a1\ufe0e Challenging but hilarious fighting game: This stickman game is a unique mix of fun and challenge with interesting features \r\n\r\nIn each battle, you need to figure out the strategy, grind for some coins, upgrade... and upgrade until you win the war! This is a great game for you to pass the time. You will enjoy the progress of building an army and lead them to the win. \r\n\r\nReady to join the battle with your stick warriors army? Download Stick Fight: Epic Warriors, the fun battles await you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Lead your warrior to the Victory! <br>Let&#39;s dive into the world where you can build your army. To defeat your rival, you have to build your stickman warriors from an unarmed army to a modern one. You will need a big brain and a solid strategy to win. <br><br>Features of Stick Fight: Epic Warriors: <br>\u25b6\ufe0e Evolve stick man from weak to strong power <br>\u25b6\ufe0e Build an army unit with different stick man warrior strengths <br>\u25b6\ufe0e Manage energy and resources to evolve your army <br><br>What makes Stick Fight: Epic Warriors different: <br>\u27a1\ufe0e Fun gameplay: Explore the fun and addictive battles between Red Stickman and Blue Stickman <br>\u27a1\ufe0e Various characters: each of them portrays a different battle style <br>\u27a1\ufe0e Challenging but hilarious fighting game: This stickman game is a unique mix of fun and challenge with interesting features <br><br>In each battle, you need to figure out the strategy, grind for some coins, upgrade... and upgrade until you win the war! This is a great game for you to pass the time. You will enjoy the progress of building an army and lead them to the win. <br><br>Ready to join the battle with your stick warriors army? Download Stick Fight: Epic Warriors, the fun battles await you!",
